{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">RECORD-LENGTH function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310468","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/RECORD-LENGTH-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/RECORD-LENGTH-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"RECORD-LENGTH-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">RECORD-LENGTH function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the length of a record in a buffer\nas an INTEGER value.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RECORD-LENGTH-function__syntax_GC1A14L2702096\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d10624e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"RECORD-LENGTH-function__idGDO2V32675648\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>RECORD-LENGTH ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">buffer</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A database buffer containing a record.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RECORD-LENGTH-function__notes_GC1A14M2702102\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d10624e140\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The\nRECORD-LENGTH function is especially useful when implementing ABL-based\ndatabase replication, which involves storing entire database records in\nlog record fields. ABL limits records to 32K. Before you transfer\na record to a raw field in another record, you can use RECORD-LENGTH\nto ensure that you are not expanding the record beyond the 32K limit.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RECORD-LENGTH-function__see-also_GC1A14O2702106\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d10624e149\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RAW-TRANSFER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RAW-TRANSFER-statement.html\">RAW-TRANSFER statement</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Record-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Record-phrase.html\">Record phrase</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"REJECTED-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/REJECTED-function.html\">REJECTED function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310468","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"RECORD-LENGTH function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RECORD-LENGTH-function.html","type":"Manual"}